n, krzzjn.com, etc.\n\nLet me update todos and write the final report. This is a substantial deliverable. I'll write it directly as my response (not necessarily a file, but I could also offer to save it). Given the user asked me to \"收集整理...并...分析...并预测\", a comprehensive written report is the deliverable. I'll provide it in the response.\n\nActually, let me consider whether to write it to a file. The user didn't explicitly ask for a file. I'll provide the full report in my response. It's long but that's appropriate.\n\nLet me write it carefully and comprehensively.",
